# The second reference emulator: KLH10, target kn10-ks-its.
# It is the submodule tools/klh10 of the ITS tree (3rdparty/its), at the
# commit that the ITS tree pins. `make oracle` checks the commit, applies
# klh10-trace.patch to a copy in the build output and builds the copy
# with the configuration of the ITS tree (its Makefile, target $(KLH10)).
